advance
wait
assert snap product-busy == false
assert snap reflections == 1
assert text What I must release
assert text Fisher–Yates
assert text C5 public deck
assert text cannot repeat
reveal class reading-spread-cards
settle 2
capture ordered-spread
reveal key narrative reading-narrative
settle 2
capture shuffled-narrative
resize 420 760
wait
assert snap product-busy == false
c5-control-reveal scene-card:next_step
settle 2
capture compact-third-card
reveal key narrative narration:foundation
settle 2
capture compact-narrative
